REM SCWORDS: marks the scene at the cursor as the block and shows its
REM word count. A scene starts after a # scene break or after the .tc
REM line of its chapter (both end in #) and runs to the next one or to
REM the end of the document.
Sub MAIN
AutoRestore(ON)
HideDots(OFF)
Key("^QD^QF#^N{Enter}")
Key("B{Enter}")
IfException
ACK: Key("{Enter}^QR")
Goto Start
End IfException
Key("^X^QS")
Start: Key("^KB^QF#^N{Enter}")
Key("{Enter}")
IfException
ACK: Key("{Enter}^QC^KK^K?")
Stop
End IfException
Key("^KK^K?")
End Sub
